WEBVTT

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:11.583
"In ancient times long past,

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:14.625
the galaxy was divided
into two colossal powers,

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:17.417
who were warring fiercely with
one another continuously.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.458
Well, I don't know if that's true or not,

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:22.208
but I, Koshi Rikdo,
hereby give my permission

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:26.667
to make the Excel Saga
anime into a sci-fi."

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.917
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:44.542
<i>Sore wa ai ja nai</i>

00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:48.375
<i>Ai wa sore ja nai</i>

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:56.333
<i>Aishite iru kedo aisarete wa inai</i>

00:00:56.333 --> 00:01:00.208
<i>Kesshite ai ja nai</i>

00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:04.208
<i>Ketsu wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:11.958
<i>Aisaretai keredo motometari wa shinai</i>

00:01:12.792 --> 00:01:16.833
<i>Kono mi sasagete inochi nagedashi</i>

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:20.708
<i>Wakime mo furazu tada hitasura ni</i>

00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:24.708
<i>Damashite sukashite yokohairi</i>

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:27.958
<i>Tanin o fumitaoshi keri o kamashite</i>

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:30.042
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:30.042 --> 00:01:31.917
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:31.917 --> 00:01:33.875
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:35.875
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:40.708
<i>Banana no kawa de korondemo</i>

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:43.958
<i>Sore wa subete ano kata no tame</i>

00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:48.375
<i>Shiite iu nara sore wa kitto</i>

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:56.250
<i>Ai to iu na no chuuseishin</i>

00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:08.208
In our last broadcast,

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:12.083
the contents of our broadcast
were very self-centered,

00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:14.292
and for that, we offer
our deepest apologies.

00:02:14.292 --> 00:02:15.958
As you can see, we have received

00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:18.708
stacks and stacks of heartwarming
letters from everyone.

00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:20.750
If the letter-opening
work hadn't taken so long,

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.000
we would have
dealt with this sooner, but...

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.083
So, we would like to take this moment

00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:30.917
to briefly explain this story
to you, just as you demanded.

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.042
The title is Excel Saga.

00:02:33.042 --> 00:02:35.833
The literal translation would
be an excellent legend of a hero,

00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:37.625
or a conspicuous tale.

00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:39.000
"Setting the Stage"

00:02:40.292 --> 00:02:42.625
Set in F City, F Prefecture.

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:46.167
In this city is a ideological secret
organization called ACROSS,

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:48.125
which is plotting to conquer the city.

00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:49.500
"Main Characters"

00:02:50.292 --> 00:02:51.792
Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:02:51.792 --> 00:02:55.292
The super-commander of ACROSS,
the ideological secret organization.

00:02:55.292 --> 00:02:57.125
A dog I picked up, Menchi.

00:02:57.125 --> 00:02:59.333
Pedro, immigrant worker.

00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:01.417
Koshi Rikdo, not appearing anymore.

00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.833
Nabeshin, looks to
be appearing every time.

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:06.792
Jobless <i>ronin</i>
A, B, and C, strangers.

00:03:06.792 --> 00:03:09.458
Mystery old guy,
appearing in episode five.

00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:11.625
Mystery woman,
appearing in episode six.

00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:13.958
Mystery secretary,
appearing in episode seven.

00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:16.792
And I am the sole member of ACROSS.

00:03:16.792 --> 00:03:19.792
Last name, Excel, first name
also Excel. In other words, Excel.

00:03:19.792 --> 00:03:21.333
My alias is Hanako Dosukoi.

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.167
Part-timer history: infinite.
Abacus, Rank 3.

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.750
No rewards or punishments.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.667
Well, basically,
Excel Saga is a story about

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:30.000
the setbacks and glories of
Lord Ilpalazzo and me

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.333
as we work towards
the conquest of the city.

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:34.833
"Ha ha ha! So that's how it was!"

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:41.708
"It's Earth."

00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:42.667
"You're right."

00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:44.125
"It's war!"

00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:45.083
"Invade!"

00:03:45.583 --> 00:03:46.417
"Dance!"

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.875
They're so cute.

00:04:09.792 --> 00:04:11.417
This is bad.

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:13.875
This is real bad!

00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:15.958
Even the drum is going drararara!

00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:19.625
Do something about it,
Great Will of the Macrocosm!

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:23.375
Hot! It's hot!

00:04:27.375 --> 00:04:33.208
This is the room that
I shared with my coworkers.

00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:37.208
Then when I was
covered with flames last time,

00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:39.833
was that all a dream?

00:04:40.917 --> 00:04:42.625
Oh, Mr. Pe.

00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:46.417
Noooooo!

00:04:47.292 --> 00:04:48.417
What, what?

00:04:48.417 --> 00:04:50.750
What?! You're at
a good spot, so not now?!

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.917
That is right.

00:04:51.917 --> 00:04:53.750
Oh, boy.

00:04:57.917 --> 00:05:00.750
Long live Emperor Zuoh!

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.167
H-How dreadful!
Or rather, what a thoughtful dream.

00:05:11.167 --> 00:05:13.042
An intro, or rather,
it dragged out this long,

00:05:13.042 --> 00:05:15.000
and the punchline just turns
out to be that it was a dream,

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.500
or rather, just terribly
stupid, or rather...

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.875
Oh, I don't know
what's what anymore.

00:05:21.042 --> 00:05:22.375
Huh?

00:05:31.792 --> 00:05:33.625
And while I was confused,

00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:37.000
here I was, fulfilling
the needs of my body.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.542
And I even have pepper
in my right hand!

00:05:39.542 --> 00:05:41.042
Spicy!

00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:45.625
I'm sorry, Menchi.

00:05:47.292 --> 00:05:49.125
Menchi, you're my final resort.

00:05:49.125 --> 00:05:52.917
You're like the gun in that
whatchamacallit military unit.

00:05:55.833 --> 00:05:57.667
You're so energetic,
this early in the morning.

00:05:57.667 --> 00:05:59.625
Even if it is noon already.

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:01.625
What are they doing next door?!

00:06:01.625 --> 00:06:03.667
You're a sensitive guy.

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:06.042
It doesn't bother me one bit.

00:06:06.125 --> 00:06:07.708
"You've got nerves of steel..."

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.667
You're not getting away from me!

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:14.292
That is not the issue here!

00:06:14.292 --> 00:06:16.083
Look at this!

00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:18.917
I'm Iwata. Norikuni Iwata.

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:20.000
"Daimaru Sumiyoshi"

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.875
"Daimaru Sumiyoshi"
"Pleased to meet ya!"

00:06:22.792 --> 00:06:24.667
I'm Nabeshin.

00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.125
Oh, don't mind me.

00:06:29.792 --> 00:06:33.208
<i>Absolutely no progress</i>
<i>has been made since last time.</i>

00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:34.833
<i>Are things going to be okay?</i>

00:06:34.833 --> 00:06:36.750
<i>Well, there's no need for me</i>

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.208
<i>to worry about such</i>
<i>things to begin with, but...</i>

00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:41.250
"In the end,"

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.000
"In the end,"
"that's your life..."

00:06:43.542 --> 00:06:45.458
By the way, is the food ready yet?

00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:49.708
Do all your worries constitute
such low-level issues?!

00:06:49.708 --> 00:06:51.792
What about how to
pay our delinquent rent?!

00:06:51.792 --> 00:06:55.208
Or how to find a job at a stable
corporation in this recession?!

00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:57.625
Or what about sending money
back to your family in the country?!

00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:01.000
Or planning out a comfortable future,
and so on, so on, so on?!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.042
Haven't you ever run what
little brain you have at full power

00:07:03.042 --> 00:07:05.375
and thought about
any of those things?!

00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:08.042
I know that! But right now,
it's time for food.

00:07:08.042 --> 00:07:09.625
"Darn right!"

00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:25.083
Menchi, watch
the place while I'm gone.

00:07:25.083 --> 00:07:28.417
Oh, please. It's rude to
the other animals out there,

00:07:28.417 --> 00:07:30.917
if you keep acting like
you understand human words.

00:07:30.917 --> 00:07:32.250
Later!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:37.333
I get the feeling that the
weather isn't looking so good.

00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:39.542
Maybe I should bring an
umbrella with me.

00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:42.125
Let's see, I think
Lord Ilpalazzo said that

00:07:42.125 --> 00:07:45.250
there was something
convenient for times like this.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:49.583
I got it! Help me, Weather Break!

00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:50.750
Weather break.

00:07:51.583 --> 00:07:54.250
Today's weather in F City,
F Prefecture will be sunny.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.417
There is no need
to worry about rain today.

00:07:56.417 --> 00:07:58.417
All right, roger, roger!

00:07:58.417 --> 00:08:00.917
As I wish for the incremental
development of ACROSS,

00:08:00.917 --> 00:08:03.500
let's go to the secret
underground base!

00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:10.792
ACROSS will conquer the city!
ACROSS will conquer the city!

00:08:10.792 --> 00:08:14.292
This is a terribly big event!
Steal, punch, shout, shut up!

00:08:14.292 --> 00:08:14.792
--Excel, Excel, Excel!

00:08:14.792 --> 00:08:17.458
--Grandpa, she's weird!
--Excel, Excel, Excel!

00:08:17.458 --> 00:08:20.875
She must be in love.

00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:22.375
Grandpa!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:32.833
I sense you.

00:08:32.833 --> 00:08:35.833
I can sense you, Space Butler.

00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:42.792
My name is Space Butler.
Don't you die before I do.

00:08:42.792 --> 00:08:46.292
So is that where you are?
Is it that important?

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:47.667
I found him! Over there!

00:08:47.667 --> 00:08:48.875
Damn.

00:08:52.417 --> 00:08:55.875
"The war dance is over.
We will now descend to Earth."

00:08:57.667 --> 00:09:00.667
"Are there any with
the courage to enlist to fight?"

00:09:00.667 --> 00:09:04.667
"Are there any who are
brave enough to die laughing?"

00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:09.333
"What brave men you are.
Take these 100 point patches!"

00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:15.917
"Now, everyone, the war dance!"

00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:21.958
They're super-cute!

00:09:22.875 --> 00:09:26.667
Well, our secret underground
base of ACROSS is in big trouble.

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:29.125
--Well, our secret underground
base of ACROSS is in big trouble.

00:09:31.333 --> 00:09:34.000
<i>Weather Break, you liar.</i>

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.417
Well, who knew that an underground
base would have such a problem?

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:40.208
What an oversight.

00:09:40.208 --> 00:09:43.292
What do you think
of this situation, Excel?

00:09:43.292 --> 00:09:44.875
Yes, well, in order to mitigate

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:47.625
this wretched situation
for the time being,

00:09:47.625 --> 00:09:50.042
I have equipped this
underling-looking wooden puppet

00:09:50.042 --> 00:09:52.042
with an optional
soy sauce pumping thingy.

00:09:52.042 --> 00:09:54.042
Then I will make her a staff officer,

00:09:54.042 --> 00:09:55.542
the option will be unit captain,

00:09:55.542 --> 00:09:58.500
and you will be the toilet cleaner.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.500
When you give
rank to inanimate objects,

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:05.333
my position as an
animate object is rather...

00:10:05.333 --> 00:10:06.875
Did you say something?

00:10:07.625 --> 00:10:11.208
With that aside, I would like
you to take a look at this person.

00:10:11.208 --> 00:10:12.583
Who is it?

00:10:12.583 --> 00:10:16.000
Takanori Asai, also known as
Choppered Nagamine.

00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:25.875
Originally from F City, F Prefecture.

00:10:25.875 --> 00:10:27.583
34 years of age, single.

00:10:27.583 --> 00:10:30.750
He continues to
play at the club Amigo

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.875
while trying to accomplish
a major debut,

00:10:32.875 --> 00:10:35.500
but this will be his
eighteenth year doing so.

00:10:38.333 --> 00:10:39.583
Any thoughts?

00:10:39.583 --> 00:10:42.250
He's practically like a truck
that's ignoring life's signboards

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.083
and running out of control.

00:10:44.083 --> 00:10:46.083
In short, a worthless idiot.

00:10:46.083 --> 00:10:48.792
Oh, might you be thinking of
making this man a cornerstone

00:10:48.792 --> 00:10:51.708
in ACROSS's conquest of the city?

00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:55.625
No, I only wanted to
hear your private impression.

00:10:55.625 --> 00:10:57.542
There's no helping it.
I will reject him.

00:10:57.542 --> 00:10:58.125
"Rejected"

00:11:03.458 --> 00:11:07.125
Lord Ilpalazzo, this place
is pretty dangerous as it is,

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:10.833
and since it's time,
may I go to my part-time job?

00:11:14.083 --> 00:11:15.625
Wait a minute.

00:11:15.625 --> 00:11:17.208
It is I.

00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:19.667
What, conquer Earth?

00:11:19.667 --> 00:11:21.292
Well, well.

00:11:21.292 --> 00:11:23.333
I can only say that
it is the idea of a fool,

00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:27.292
who can only grasp
generalized concepts.

00:11:27.292 --> 00:11:30.458
Well, if they are Martians,
perhaps it cannot be helped.

00:11:30.458 --> 00:11:34.750
Understood. I will return to
my normal strategic operations.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.833
Hey, that isn't the point...

00:11:36.833 --> 00:11:39.000
Thank you for waiting, Exce--

00:11:43.667 --> 00:11:45.667
Such an impatient girl.

00:12:03.208 --> 00:12:05.875
I'll make you turn out tasty!

00:12:16.333 --> 00:12:18.708
"All right!"

00:12:57.875 --> 00:12:59.583
What the hell is going on?!

00:12:59.583 --> 00:13:02.750
Right when I'm eating a cup of
ramen made with lukewarm water.

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.542
Hey! What is it?!
You people are so noisy!

00:13:05.542 --> 00:13:08.875
Be a little quieter, will you?! Hey!

00:13:08.875 --> 00:13:10.875
Aren't they there?

00:13:23.958 --> 00:13:25.625
You...

00:13:36.083 --> 00:13:38.917
Well, that is...

00:13:39.917 --> 00:13:42.875
It's all flooded with this rain.

00:13:48.833 --> 00:13:50.708
What was with that?

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:55.667
♪ Do you know my name? ♪

00:13:55.667 --> 00:13:58.792
♪ It's a secret, so I won't tell you. ♪

00:13:58.792 --> 00:14:01.958
♪ Already three days since I started
delivering the evening paper. ♪

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:03.792
♪ Still only three days. ♪

00:14:03.792 --> 00:14:09.667
♪ More like a flood than
just a little seepage. ♪

00:14:09.667 --> 00:14:12.333
Cars floating by.
Store signs floating by.

00:14:12.333 --> 00:14:15.208
Mysterious carbohydrates floating by.

00:14:15.208 --> 00:14:17.583
If it sweeps everything away,

00:14:17.583 --> 00:14:21.125
our conquest will be over before
we know it without any effort!

00:14:25.833 --> 00:14:29.375
"Nothing here..."

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:33.000
What's the point
of imagining it like that?!

00:14:47.125 --> 00:14:48.500
Menchi!

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.167
Menchi!

00:14:50.167 --> 00:14:51.542
Menchi!

00:14:53.417 --> 00:14:56.417
Why you are here
is a profound mystery.

00:15:03.875 --> 00:15:07.583
Oh, where did that energy
go that you had just a minute ago?

00:15:07.583 --> 00:15:08.875
Get a hold of yourself, Menchi.

00:15:08.875 --> 00:15:12.625
Besides, you won't be of any
use to me in case of an emergency.

00:15:12.625 --> 00:15:14.292
Hey, you're energetic again!

00:15:14.292 --> 00:15:16.792
Now, since I've finished my work,
I'll make a side dish...

00:15:16.792 --> 00:15:19.833
No, I'll make a meal out of you.

00:15:19.833 --> 00:15:22.208
Bicycle, bicycle.

00:15:26.208 --> 00:15:29.208
I only looked away for maybe
thirty seconds to a minute.

00:15:29.208 --> 00:15:31.208
What a dexterous theft!

00:15:32.583 --> 00:15:34.958
But it's okay!
I won't let it get to me!

00:15:34.958 --> 00:15:37.375
Right when the dawn
of our conquest is near,

00:15:37.375 --> 00:15:39.250
I cannot stand here

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.292
and succumb to something
as trivial as a national conspiracy!

00:15:42.292 --> 00:15:43.958
Hey, what's that?!

00:15:46.667 --> 00:15:48.583
It's cute.

00:15:48.583 --> 00:15:50.667
It's cute, but...

00:15:50.667 --> 00:15:53.917
So what?!

00:16:03.917 --> 00:16:06.125
Excel treatment concluded!

00:16:06.125 --> 00:16:08.667
In other words, it has
been democratically decided

00:16:08.667 --> 00:16:11.750
by a vote of 99 against 1
that this is a super-weapon

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:15.667
that has been sent by ACROSS
to me for the conquest of the city!

00:16:15.667 --> 00:16:18.458
"Made in Mars" is written here,

00:16:18.458 --> 00:16:21.667
but I will utterly ignore it,
which equals recklessness!

00:16:21.667 --> 00:16:23.708
Here we go, lady!

00:16:25.333 --> 00:16:28.958
The nest of the ignorant
and incompetent scum,

00:16:28.958 --> 00:16:31.917
who exist only to be
conquered by Lord Ilpalazzo.

00:16:31.917 --> 00:16:34.292
I have seen the end of F City,
F Prefecture!

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.875
My, my, my.

00:16:38.875 --> 00:16:41.458
You made people
excessively expectant of you.

00:16:41.458 --> 00:16:44.625
I don't think a punch line
like this is very fair!

00:16:44.625 --> 00:16:45.958
Yo!

00:16:46.583 --> 00:16:51.042
Yo! My name is Nanami!
I'll make some kind of progress!

00:16:51.042 --> 00:16:54.542
I'll concentrate my will
and fire! Nice to meet you! Yo!

00:16:54.542 --> 00:16:57.667
It's got a very manly-sounding
built-in speech help function!

00:16:57.667 --> 00:16:58.958
Feels very hi-tech!

00:16:58.958 --> 00:17:01.750
That's ACROSS for you!
There's definitely something extraordinary

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.292
about the enthusiasm it
has for the conquest of the city!

00:17:04.292 --> 00:17:07.292
Well, let's fire a shot!
Guarandoo!

00:17:15.083 --> 00:17:16.500
Princess!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.917
All right, this is my chance!

00:17:18.917 --> 00:17:21.833
Is that sort of my fault?

00:17:22.917 --> 00:17:24.833
"Hurry! We're going back!"

00:17:25.708 --> 00:17:28.292
"The invasion of Earth
is on temporary hold."

00:17:30.833 --> 00:17:32.417
Okay, now!

00:17:32.417 --> 00:17:34.000
What's this? What's all this?

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:34.833
"Who are you?!"

00:17:35.208 --> 00:17:36.667
"A warrior of Earth?!"

00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:39.667
So cute.

00:17:39.667 --> 00:17:40.375
--So what?!

00:17:40.375 --> 00:17:41.833
--Ow!
--So what?!

00:17:41.833 --> 00:17:45.417
You think to conquer the city with
such wimpy spirit?! Preposterous!

00:17:45.417 --> 00:17:46.875
Take this, Excel Punch!

00:17:46.875 --> 00:17:49.250
Take this too, Excel Kick!

00:17:54.542 --> 00:17:56.042
I can't help but feel
that this development

00:17:56.042 --> 00:17:57.875
is deviating from
the normal course of events,

00:17:57.875 --> 00:18:00.250
but are you going to reset
this at some point or something?!

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.250
Great Will of the Macrocosm?

00:18:04.375 --> 00:18:06.583
You're such an innocent, Mr. Pe.

00:18:06.583 --> 00:18:08.542
Nooooo!

00:18:09.208 --> 00:18:11.167
No reaction!

00:18:11.167 --> 00:18:14.708
I got it! This is another of ACROSS's
awesome secret weapons!

00:18:14.708 --> 00:18:16.542
I'm right, aren't I,
Lord Ilpalazzo?!

00:18:16.542 --> 00:18:19.875
Thank you very much!
With this, Excel will be invincible!

00:18:19.875 --> 00:18:23.250
The incomprehensible whatsit gun
and aerial transportation device!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.583
And I'm even fully equipped with
my emergency food supply, Menchi!

00:18:26.583 --> 00:18:28.375
With this luxurious set
of three items,

00:18:28.375 --> 00:18:30.833
I will grasp the future of ACROSS!

00:18:30.833 --> 00:18:34.375
We go! To the city's
central executive facility!

00:18:34.375 --> 00:18:36.375
It's not going!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:42.042
Help manual, discovered!

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:44.750
Unable to decipher!

00:18:47.708 --> 00:18:53.208
Now is my chance to
take the princess to Earth...

00:18:53.208 --> 00:18:55.167
"You betrayed us, Space Butler!"

00:18:58.625 --> 00:19:03.083
No! I must not
look at them! I must not!

00:19:03.083 --> 00:19:05.417
But even as I say that...

00:19:06.208 --> 00:19:09.750
Oh, it's no good.
They're so cute! Oh...

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.875
Don't give up!

00:19:10.875 --> 00:19:12.417
N-Nabeshin!

00:19:12.417 --> 00:19:14.667
So, you remember me,
Space Butler!

00:19:14.667 --> 00:19:17.250
Who would have thought
I'd end up helping you out now?

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:19.542
I'll beat the
crap out of these guys!

00:19:19.542 --> 00:19:22.208
Nabeshin, it's no use doing that...

00:19:23.792 --> 00:19:25.292
I'm telling you...

00:19:25.292 --> 00:19:28.000
What's wrong?! Come and get me!

00:19:30.458 --> 00:19:33.042
Oh, it's no good after all!

00:19:37.208 --> 00:19:39.125
Take that!

00:19:39.125 --> 00:19:42.875
How could such a
giant facility exist in space?!

00:19:42.875 --> 00:19:46.042
ACROSS will take
this facility in its entirety!

00:19:46.042 --> 00:19:49.292
Are you watching,
Lord Ilpalazzo?! Look at my work!

00:19:49.292 --> 00:19:50.750
"Third bridge has
been heavily damaged!!"

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:51.958
"Power dropping!!"

00:19:52.292 --> 00:19:54.250
"Engine three has stopped!"

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.958
What in the world is this?

00:20:01.958 --> 00:20:04.833
They tricked me! Me!

00:20:04.833 --> 00:20:06.250
Me too!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.833
And I'd thought
they were so cute!

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:09.833
"Capture them!!"

00:20:10.917 --> 00:20:11.875
"Stop! Don't let them get away!"

00:20:11.875 --> 00:20:13.750
"Stop! Don't let them get away!"
And they're shooting too!

00:20:14.667 --> 00:20:15.667
What's wrong?

00:20:15.667 --> 00:20:18.292
I'll hold them off here.
You go on ahead.

00:20:18.292 --> 00:20:19.292
But...

00:20:19.292 --> 00:20:21.208
Please take care of the princess.

00:20:21.208 --> 00:20:24.458
I have not forgotten that
vow in Pogota.

00:20:27.083 --> 00:20:30.000
Don't die, Butler!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.583
Thank you, Nabeshin.

00:20:34.667 --> 00:20:37.000
When did this happen?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:42.375
Oh, I miss those days.

00:20:42.375 --> 00:20:44.708
We could do anything.

00:20:44.708 --> 00:20:48.500
No, we believed that
we could do anything.

00:20:58.583 --> 00:21:00.250
So nostalgic.

00:21:02.792 --> 00:21:07.750
You guys are cute, truly cute.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:11.875
But between my promise
to a friend and your cuteness,

00:21:11.875 --> 00:21:14.833
there's a world of difference.

00:21:14.833 --> 00:21:17.708
Quit crying "puchuu puchuu"!

00:21:17.708 --> 00:21:19.125
Adios.

00:21:28.458 --> 00:21:30.083
Bitch!

00:21:31.333 --> 00:21:34.250
Before I knew what was what,
look at what's happened!

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.958
Farewell, Excel Saga!

00:21:35.958 --> 00:21:37.375
From good morning to good night,

00:21:37.375 --> 00:21:39.875
this program was brought
to you by Japan Vic...

00:21:49.792 --> 00:21:52.292
The way you look and
the way you are dressed...

00:21:52.292 --> 00:21:54.625
...you must be additional
personnel from HQ.

00:21:54.625 --> 00:21:59.542
Welcome to my ideological
secret organization, ACROSS.

00:22:06.375 --> 00:22:07.542
What is your nationality?

00:22:07.542 --> 00:22:09.333
If it's my code name...

00:22:09.333 --> 00:22:10.792
How old are you?

00:22:10.792 --> 00:22:12.292
Unspecified.

00:22:12.292 --> 00:22:13.750
What are you here for?!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:15.208
I don't know.

00:22:15.208 --> 00:22:18.125
Colonel, she understands
what's being said!

00:22:18.125 --> 00:22:19.292
Tie her up.

00:22:19.292 --> 00:22:20.667
Yes, Sir!

00:22:20.667 --> 00:22:25.333
"Episode 2: The Woman From Mars"

00:22:25.333 --> 00:22:27.333
"Episode 2: The Woman From Mars"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:27.333 --> 00:22:29.083
"Episode 2: The Woman From Mars"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:50.917 --> 00:22:59.333
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.333 --> 00:23:06.750
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:14.833 --> 00:23:23.625
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.583 --> 00:23:32.375
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.375 --> 00:23:40.250
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.125
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:56.875
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:24:01.292 --> 00:24:02.875
Now, for next week's Excel Saga...

00:24:02.875 --> 00:24:04.375
Good evening, my name is Hyatt.

00:24:04.375 --> 00:24:05.833
How has everyone been these days,

00:24:05.833 --> 00:24:08.417
when the cold is so bitter
you almost freeze to death?

00:24:08.417 --> 00:24:11.625
I tried planting a persimmon
seed in front of the apartment,

00:24:11.625 --> 00:24:13.542
but nothing has changed at all.

00:24:13.542 --> 00:24:15.583
Perhaps I need peanuts after all,

00:24:15.583 --> 00:24:18.792
or could something
very basic be wrong?

00:24:18.792 --> 00:24:19.583
That's right!

00:24:19.583 --> 00:24:21.333
Let's see. Oh, next time is:

00:24:21.333 --> 00:24:23.417
Episode 3: The Sacrificial Lamb of
the Venomous Great Escape of Hell

00:24:23.417 --> 00:24:24.750
--That's all we'll be showing.

00:24:24.750 --> 00:24:28.635
--That's all!
--That's all we'll be showing.
